A||||15||PaUL||Irridescent Paint||||
Z||000000||PaUL||07-08-99||05:36 PM||||A few weeks ago I saw an unusual Honda Civic. It looked like your typical rice boy car except for the paint job, it was irridescent like a soap bubble or oil film on water. The colors changed dramatically when viewed from different angles. You couldnt describe this paint as a single color. Ive never seen anything like it. Anyone here know anything about this paint?
